1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,467
♪ In the
not too distant future ♪

2
00:00:03,467 --> 00:00:06,233
♪ Next Sunday AD ♪

3
00:00:06,233 --> 00:00:09,467
♪ There was a guy named Joel ♪

4
00:00:09,467 --> 00:00:12,600
