Gizmonic Institute ♪

6
00:00:15,567 --> 00:00:18,567
♪ Just another face
in a red jumpsuit ♪

7
00:00:18,567 --> 00:00:21,467
♪ He did a good job
cleaning up the place ♪

8
00:00:21,467 --> 00:00:23,133
♪ But his bosses
didn't like him ♪

9
00:00:23,133 --> 00:00:27,967
♪ So they shot him into space ♪

10
00:00:27,967 --> 00:00:31,367
♪ We'll send him cheesy movies ♪

11
00:00:31,367 --> 00:00:34,800
♪ The worst we can
find, la la la ♪

12
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:37,233
♪ He'll have to sit
and watch them all ♪

13
00:00:37,233 --> 00:00:40,100
♪ And we'll monitor his mind ♪

14
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:43,133
♪ Now keep in mind
Joel can't control ♪

15
00:00:43,133 --> 00:00:46,433
♪ Where the movies
