19
00:00:56,067 --> 00:00:57,267
♪ Cambot ♪

20
00:00:57,267 --> 00:00:58,633
♪ Gypsy ♪

21
00:00:58,633 --> 00:01:00,100
♪ Tom Servo! ♪

22
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:02,100
♪ Crow ♪

23
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:05,300
♪ If you're wondering how
he eats and breathes ♪

24
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,167
♪ And other science
facts, la la la ♪

25
00:01:08,167 --> 00:01:09,667
♪ Then repeat to yourself ♪

26
00:01:09,667 --> 00:01:14,300
♪ It's just a show I
should really just relax ♪

27
00:01:14,300 --> 00:01:18,533
♪ For Mystery Science
Theater 3000 ♪

28
00:01:20,633 --> 00:01:23,133
(doors clank)

29
00:01:30,100 --> 00:01:32,033
- [Announcer] 30 seconds
to commercial sign.

30
00:01:32,033 --> 00:01:33,733
- Hey, everybody,
it's me, it's Joel,

31
00:01:33,733 --> 00:01:35,367
I'm marooned out in outer space,

32
00:01:35,367 --> 00:01:37,467
