in the vacuum with me.

33
00:01:37,467 --> 00:01:39,567
The robots are throwing
me a little party today.

34
00:01:39,567 --> 00:01:42,733
- [Announcer] Commercial
sign in 15 seconds.

35
00:01:42,733 --> 00:01:45,033
