our rugged good looks,

70
00:03:22,533 --> 00:03:24,500
- Maybe our hair.

71
00:03:24,500 --> 00:03:26,800
- Nothing wrong
with my hair, Larry,

72
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:28,167
- Jeepers.

73
00:03:28,167 --> 00:03:29,500
You guys look like something

74
00:03:29,500 --> 00:03:32,000
