children's book.

75
00:03:33,100 --> 00:03:34,567
- [Both] Thank you.

76
00:03:34,567 --> 00:03:38,700
- Well, your film today, Joel
is called Black Scorpion.

77
00:03:38,700 --> 00:03:42,433
It's a Mexican film with
effects by Ray Harryhousen,

78
00:03:42,433 --> 00:03:45,667
the man who brought you The
Seven Voyages of Sinbad.

79
00:03:45,667 --> 00:03:47,367
