blue screen action

80
00:03:47,367 --> 00:03:49,033
and jerky monster movement.

81
00:03:49,033 --> 00:03:51,767
But at least there's no
recognizable talent in it.

82
00:03:51,767 --> 00:03:52,600
Enjoy.

83
00:03:53,900 --> 00:03:58,833
- Oh we got movies!

84
00:03:58,833 --> 00:04:01,300
(doors clank)

85
00:04:08,967 --> 00:04:11,233
Man those scientists
really looked terrible.

86
00:04:11,233 --> 00:04:13,967
