177
00:08:08,067 --> 00:08:10,533
- Oh I didn't use
Spanish with her.

178
00:08:10,533 --> 00:08:11,967
- [Joel] I used Greek, it really

179
00:08:11,967 --> 00:08:13,400
confused the hell out of her.

180
00:08:22,433 --> 00:08:23,300
- Incredible.

181
00:08:23,300 --> 00:08:24,567
Truly isn't it?

182
00:08:24,567 --> 00:08:25,700
