185
00:08:30,200 --> 00:08:31,667
- San Francisco.

186
00:08:31,667 --> 00:08:34,333
Lucky there are so
few people up here.

187
00:08:34,333 --> 00:08:36,167
- Well there were enough.

188
00:08:39,533 --> 00:08:41,600
