191
00:08:49,100 --> 00:08:51,500
- Mexico City we left on Monday.

192
00:08:51,500 --> 00:08:53,633
- Where did you want to go?
- San Lorenzo.

193
00:08:53,633 --> 00:08:55,233
How far is it, do you know?

194
00:08:55,233 --> 00:08:56,900
- Who knows how the bridges are.

195
00:08:56,900 --> 00:08:59,067
