- Maybe a couple of hours.

196
00:08:59,067 --> 00:09:00,767
- A police car went by
just before sundown.

197
00:09:00,767 --> 00:09:03,667
They didn't come back, so
maybe they got through okay.

198
00:09:03,667 --> 00:09:05,800
- Was San Lorenzo hurt badly?

199
00:09:05,800 --> 00:09:07,300
- Who knows?

200
00:09:07,300 --> 00:09:09,567
The telephone lines are
down since the earthquake.

201
00:09:10,833 --> 00:09:11,867
