202
00:09:11,867 --> 00:09:12,700
See you later.

203
00:09:12,700 --> 00:09:13,633
- Take it easy.

204
00:09:13,633 --> 00:09:15,100
- [Crow] Goodbye, see you later.

205
00:09:15,100 --> 00:09:16,500
Auf wiedersehen.

206
00:09:16,500 --> 00:09:18,233
Hasta luego.

207
00:09:18,233 --> 00:09:20,667
