209
00:09:25,833 --> 00:09:27,733
Is that my stomach
growling or yours?

210
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:31,333
- What the devil was that?

211
00:09:31,333 --> 00:09:32,167
- I don't know.

212
00:09:33,833 --> 00:09:35,900
