Jeep, two bottles of beer ♪

220
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:53,500
♪ Pass one down,
pass it around ♪

221
00:09:53,500 --> 00:09:56,867
♪ Beer in the Jeep. ♪

222
00:09:56,867 --> 00:09:58,433
